SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This licence covers the CODE in this repository. It does not cover, and this
repository does not redistribute:

  - the scientific architecture of the 20 October 2026 MesoReach briefing, which
    is the author's own research programme and is described here rather than
    reproduced;
  - the Nano-Tumor Database or the Nano-AI-QSAR reference implementation
    (UFPBPK), which remain under their own terms;
  - any experimental data. There is none in this repository: every number in the
    test suite is either a declared parameter, a simulated draw with a fixed
    seed, or a structural property computed from the code itself.

NOTE ON MODEL STATUS. Nothing here is a validated model of a biological system.
The mechanistic components exist so that the architecture can be exercised and
audited; they are not calibrated against experimental data, and
`atcs.worldmodel.credibility` will refuse every patient-facing context of use by
construction. Do not use this software to inform a clinical decision.
